MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_001: The sensor is ready. This should help you find your\nepimenium.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_002: Your best bet will be in the north passage. There\nshould still be some epimenium deep within it.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_003: It is dangerous, but you seem capable of handling\nyourselves just fine.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_004: And you'll have Long assisting you too. He knows\nthe place well.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_005: Thank you. I promise that I will return with the \nepimenium in hand.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_006: Are you ready to venture into the {SetColor=Gold}northern passage{SetColor=Default}?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_007: <ICA>Say yes.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01_008: <ICB>Say no.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Zen_m01: <BLN>The sensor is ready.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m01_001: Like Troy, Long has earned a great deal of respect\namong the forest peoples.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m01_002: I confess that we had never met in person prior to\nnow, but I knew him by reputation.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m01_003: I certainly never thought that I would accompany\nhim to the forbidden land at my age.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m01_004: Life never ceases to amaze with the twists it has in\nstore for each of us...
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Bon_m01: <BLN>What a turn of events!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m01_001: I knew the arm was weird, boss, but the demon god\nBalor wouldn't have even been my tenth guess.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m01_002: That explains why it's so damned powerful.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m01_003: Mahadu sure left a hell of a gift for his descendants\nto stumble over.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Tob_m01: <BLN>Who knew it came from Balor?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m01_001: There's something about being around Master Long\nthat kinda puts me at ease.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m01_002: Can't put my finger on it, though. He sort of reminds\nme of my grandpa on my dad's side.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m01_003: Man, I haven't thought of Grandpa in forever.\nHe died when I was little.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m01_004: But yeah, these folks are supposed to have common\nancestors with us, so maybe we're distant cousins?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Lil_m01: <BLN>He reminds me of my grandpa.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01_001: I had heard about Troy from my uncle,\nChancellor Kumos.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01_002: Now that I've met her, I was surprised to find that\nshe's a bit...feistier than I had imagined.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01_003: I'm told both your father, King Sergio, and his\npredecessor, King Lugius, owed a great deal to her.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01_004: But if that's true...how long has she been alive?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01_005: It's hard to wrap my head around a human being\nliving for so long. And yet she's not a god.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Lys_m01: <BLN>How long has she been alive?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01_001: Queen Theodora, we are distant kin. My ancestors\nare also yours.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01_002: We have had to fight to survive our oppressors\nthroughout our history.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01_003: The Battle of Fezzan at Kunlun, the unjust slaughter\nof Damascar...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01_004: At every turn, we faced extermination while holding\ntight to our bonds and protecting each other.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01_005: That is why I consider you all to be my own family.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01_006: Troy asked me to help you. But I had my own\nreasons as well.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Lon_m01: <BLN>I want to help you.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m02_001: The grandeur of the structure seems at odds with the\nmeager existence these people eke out.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m02_002: I cannot fathom how they go on. And yet...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m02_003: They live so fiercely despite the harsh environment.\nThe depth of human resilience is truly astounding.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Bon_m02_004: I am almost moved to tears to behold it.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Bon_m02: <BLN>Human resilience is astounding.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m02_001: Some kids were begging me to play with 'em. What\nkinda Saraminian warrior would I be if I said no?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m02_002: I still can't get over this place, y'know.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m02_003: The Egg is one thing, but then again, Dagda the\nGreat must've been no slouch to bust it up.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Tob_m02_004: I tell you, if I saw more stuff like this, I wouldn't\nworry about my teeth falling out over small surprises.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Tob_m02: <BLN>Sure is impressive.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m02_001: What's the deal with this Egg?! The more I try to\ntake it all in, the more I realize how huge it is!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lil_m02_002: Even after seeing it with my own eyes, it's hard to\nbelieve our people came from here.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Lil_m02: <BLN>I don't believe it...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m02_001: The White Egg is more majestic than I imagined.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m02_002: A year ago, I'd have scoffed at the idea I'd someday\nset foot in this fabled land.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lys_m02_003: Were we humans always capable of creating things\nlike this?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Lys_m02: <BLN>The pinnacle of human ingenuity...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m02_001: My mission only calls for me to be here for a short\nwhile each year.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m02_002: Each time I come back, there are fewer and fewer\npeople, and the environment feels all the harsher.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_Lon_m02_003: We need to make a major move if we hope to break\nout of this bleak cycle.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_Lon_m02: <BLN>This village won't last much longer.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B01_m01_001: So, you're the queen of Saramis, huh? Your ancestors\nwere our kin, which practically makes us family.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B01_m01_002: We don't have much here except sand, but I hope\nwe can make you feel welcome.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B01_m01: <BLN>We're practically family.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B02_m01_001: It's rare for us to get outsiders in the village. We\nshould prepare a banquet for you!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B02_m01_002: There might be some smoked sandworm left from the\nones Anatolia took down early this year.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B02_m01_003: I'll get Zenon's permission to fish some out of storage.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B02_m01: <BLN>We should treat you.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B03_m01_001: Many who leave are either fed up with conditions\nhere, or they break the rules and get banished.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B03_m01_002: Either way, most of them die trying to make it\nthrough the underground passage.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B03_m01_003: Which makes banishment pretty much the same as\nthe death penalty for us.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B03_m01_004: It might seem harsh, but we're on a razor's edge here.\nOnly our rules keep us all from being wiped out.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B03_m01: <BLN>It's harsh, but necessary.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B04_m01_001: Ahh, very interesting. Congratulations on returning\nto your home.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B04_m01_002: You are the descendants of the children that Yu Phas\nsaved, yes?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B04_m01_003: The road has been long indeed for you...but this is\nthe place where it began.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B04_m01: <BLN>Congratulations on returning home.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B05_m01_001: Things weren't always this bad, but another well\ndried up recently.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B05_m01_002: So right now we're on rations of one scoop of water\nper day.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B05_m01_003: I'm ashamed we can't provide enough water to meet\nour guests' needs... I hope you can forgive us.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B05_m01: <BLN>It's a true shame.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B06_m01_001: Master Long looks a little worse than he did the last\ntime he was here. I'm worried about him.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B06_m01_002: I wish he wouldn't push himself so hard at his age.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B06_m01: <BLN>I'm worried about Master Long...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B07_m01_001: That tough-looking guy reminds me a bit of my late\ngrandfather.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B07_m01_002: Who knows? We have ancestors in common, so\nmaybe we're actually related somehow.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B07_m01: <BLN>Maybe we're related somehow.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B08_m01_001: We almost never get strangers here!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B08_m01_002: Where'd you come from, lady?! Tell me all about\nthe world outside the walls!
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B08_m01: <BLN>I wanna hear it all!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B09_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B09_m01_001: Master Long told me we're related to you from way\nback. Is that true?
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B09_m01_002: That's amazing! Then this is like you're coming\nhome, huh?
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B09_m01: <BLN>It's like you've come home!
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B010_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B010_m01_001: I hope Dadao is behaving himself...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B010_m01_002: He's strong, and kind, and smart, but he can be\npretty dumb too.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B010_m01_003: So I hope he's not making trouble for Anatolia by\nsaying weird stuff.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B010_m01: <BLN>I hope he's doing OK...
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B011_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B011_m01_001: Do you know Anatolia? We call her the raven-haired\nprincess here.
MID_LGV_1SEO_c09_B011_m01_002: She's super strong, and pretty, and cool! She went\nover to the outside world to help us all out.
MID_LGA_1SEO_c09_B011_m01: <BLN>Anatolia's the coolest.